# Working trees a harness cuts for its own helpers, which land inside the
# checkout and are not this project's work trees -- `branch_model.tree_dir`
# states where those go. Named here because this is the project's own file:
# the toolkit's shared code may not name a harness's directory, and does not.
.claude/worktrees/

# The untracked half of this project's configuration -- `private.source` addresses it and
# `private.keys` names what it supplies (schema § 28). Ignored because the whole point of the
# facet is that these values are not committed.
.claude/mjolnir.private.yaml
